        "name": "Dauntless Instinct",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "K'Sante's Abilities mark targets to take more damage on his next Attack.<br><br>When All Out, K'Sante deals more damage with all Attacks and Abilities.",
        "bodyHtml": "K'Sante's damaging Abilities mark enemies hit. Attacking a marked enemy deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">12 plus ? max Health physical damage</span> and consumes the mark.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">All Out</span>: K'Sante's Attacks, Abilities and Passive deal an additional (1% + (0.01% bonus Armor) + (0.01% bonus Magic Resist)) max Health physical damage.",
