        "bodyHtml": "K'Sante dashes, gaining <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(70/112.5/155/197.5/240 + (13.5% bonus Health)) Shield</span> for 2 seconds. If dashing to an ally, the distance of the dash is significantly increased and the ally is also <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">Shielded</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">All Out</span>: Cooldown is decreased by 50% and dash speed is increased.",
