      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "KSanteR",
        "name": "All Out",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "K'Sante knocks an enemy back, launching them through any wall in their path. Then, K'Sante goes All Out and dashes after them, gaining increased damage, healing, and transformed abilities at the cost of reduced defenses.",
        "bodyHtml": "K'Sante shatters his ntofos to <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knock Back</span> an enemy champion, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">80/115/150 physical damage</span>, then dashes behind them and goes <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">All Out</span> for 15s. If the enemy would hit a wall, they are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Back</span> through the wall and K'Sante strikes them again for <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(80/115/150 + (5% bonus Health)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br />While <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">All Out</span>, K'Sante's Abilities are upgraded and he gains <span>40/60/80% Attack Speed</span>, 50% Bonus Armor Penetration, and <span>20% Omnivamp</span>, but loses <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">35% max Health</span>, <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">85% Bonus Armor</span>, and <span>85% Bonus Magic Resistance</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">K'Sante is Unstoppable and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Roots</span> his target while casting this Ability.</span>",
